 "text": "9/29/26, 10:19 AM\n\nRelease\n\nt\n\nCreate disc. doc.\nworkflow (ISUDISC12)\n\nt\n\nConfirm disc.\norder workflow\n\n(ISUDISCREP12)\n\nt\n\n|\nCreate disc.\n\ndoc.\n(Disconnect.\nCreated)\n\nInferrupt disc.\nworkflow\n\n(ISUDISCBREAK)\n\n!\nTrigger disc.\n\nrequest\n(Disconnect.\nDisconOrderCrea)\n\n|\nDisc. order\n\ncreaied (Disaction.\nDisconordercreated)\n\nMove-out occurred (Disconnect.\n\n\u00ab\u2014MoveOutOccured) or disc. reason           *\n\nobsolete (Disconnect.DisconReasonObsolete)\n\nReconn. Order\ncreated\n\n(Disaction.\n\nReconordercreated)\n\nCreate reconn.\norder\n(Disconnect.Recon\nordercrea)\n\nTime\n\nComplete\n\nWorkflow Model\n\nConfirm reconn, order\n\nVforkflow\n(ISURECREP12)\n\nCreate reconn. order\nWorkflow (ISUREC12)\n\nThe process flow of the main workflow for Disconnection/Reconnection is as follows:\n\nCustomer payment\nor\n\nmove-out\n\nAnalyse disconnection\ndocument status.\n\nDisconnection carried\nout?\n\nThe Reverse Disconnection Workflow (ISUDISCSTORN) is not depicted in this model since it would affect clarity.\n\nYou can configure the system to generate a contract-related proposal for the object to be disconnected/reconnected. You do this\n\nin Customizing under Define Processing Variants for Disconnection Documents. You can change this proposal in dialog.\n\n\u201c4S Caution\n\nWorkflows and Remote Disconnection and Reconnection of AMI Devices\n\nIf you are working in an advanced metering infrastructure (AMI) environment , you cannot integrate activities that feature\n\nremote disconnection and reconnection of AMI devices (such as advanced meters or smart meters) into SAP Business\n\nWorkflow processes \u2014 this would conflict with the direct communication processing used for these devices.\n\nInstead, you need to adjust your operating procedures to manually execute any workflow step related to remote disconnection\n\nand reconnection activit\n\nies.\n\nNicnnnnanntinn /Dannnnanntinn nf oo / ltilitinc Ipnctallatinn\n",
